{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034820/extras/5f1406a6e9f3b3f8e676cb546538883c.avif?t=1758136236\" width=770 height=222 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rising Odds\u00a0</strong>is a horror visual novel with multi-endings. <br> Your decisions will impact how the story ends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten people are kidnapped by a strange individual named &quot;The Host&quot;, forcing them to play the game of &quot;Rising Odds&quot;. The rules are simple, when the countdown hits zero, only one participant chosen at random will be able to leave this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034820/extras/95a44597effc9cb654052dd2fc588111.avif?t=1758136236\" width=770 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make things more interesting, the Host also gave each participant a unique &quot;gift&quot;, which could be used to save someone in need, to defend themselves or... to fulfill a purpose far more sinister.  <br>Will the participants rely on their good fortune and cooperate with each other? Or will they create better odds for themselves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You did not ask to play this game.\u00a0  <br>Nevertheless, you are trapped in this abandoned prison and will fight to survive. Will you discover the truth behind this game? Who is behind it? But most importantly, how to escape this place alive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034820/extras/14f54f341a4f53c25a400c904846999a.avif?t=1758136236\" width=770 height=174 /></span><br>DEMO FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ minutes of story</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game contains scenes of violence, suicide and murder.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034820?t=1758136236","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034820?t=1758136236","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034820/40efeefa37552742ccd915cb470294c79ed2c67b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758136236","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034820/40efeefa37552742ccd915cb470294c79ed2c67b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758136236","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains intense violence, death, blood and gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034820/extras/5f1406a6e9f3b3f8e676cb546538883c.avif?t=1758136236\" width=770 height=222 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rising Odds\u00a0</strong>is a horror visual novel with multi-endings. <br> Your decisions will impact how the story ends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten people are kidnapped by a strange individual named &quot;The Host&quot;, forcing them to play the game of &quot;Rising Odds&quot;. The rules are simple, when the countdown hits zero, only one participant chosen at random will be able to leave this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=